# Allowlist: the context is limited to the server, its competition catalogue and the lineup it
# reads. The rest of the repository — including `.tooling/` and its sixteen gigabytes of Android
# tools, the build machine's `.env` and the APKs it publishes — has no business in an image.
*
!backend/*.py
backend/test_*.py
!backend/competitions.json
!android/app/src/main/assets/match.json
